            "line": 134,
            "text": "theorem velocity_one (H K : Profile) (t : ℝ) (x : Space)\n    (hH : DifferentiableAt ℝ H (profilePoint t x))\n    (hK : DifferentiableAt ℝ K (profilePoint t x)) :\n    velocity H K (t, x) 1 =\n      -x 1 * partialZ H (profilePoint t x) / 2 - x 0 * partialS K (profilePoint t x)"
          }
